InfluxDB bridge for the imud IMU daemon
 imud-influxdb connects to imud's local binary stream socket and writes one
 InfluxDB line-protocol point per tick — quaternion, attitude, heading, rate
 of turn, heave, and the full fusion diagnostics (gyro bias and variance,
 quiescence) — over UDP or HTTP, for time-series storage and Grafana
 dashboards. Pure C, no external dependencies.
